  "schema:name": "Rapid U-Pb Geochronology by Laser Ablation Multi-Collector ICP-MS",
  "schema:description": "Zircon U-Pb dates acquired by multi-collector LA-ICP-MS at 120, 300, 600 and 1200 analyses per hour (30, 12, 6 and 3 s per analysis), demonstrated on twelve zircon reference materials with dates from ~3465 to ~28 Ma and on detrital zircons from sandstone sample CP40. Mean offset from high-precision dates rises from 0.9% to 1.1% with rate; mean random 1s uncertainty from 0.6% to 1.3%.",
  "schema:additionalType": [
    "Multi-Collector Inductively Coupled Plasma Mass Spectrometry",
    "ada:DataDeliveryPackage"
  ],
